&SQUISH
Command: SQUISH		Abbr: SQ		Utility: PIP.SV

}SQUISH dev:

The squish command eliminates any embedded empty files on the specified device.

NOTES:
	1) A device error during a squish operation leaves
	the entire contents of the device corrupted in a
	non-obvious way.  Therefore, do not use this command
	unless you have a backup copy of the disk being squished.

	2) Once you have executed a squish, do not interrupt the
	process.  This WILL corrupt your disk!!

